{"summary":"Unique puzzle game to sharpen your mind!","description":"Welcome to Orixo - your new favourite puzzle game! \n\nThis simple, yet challenging game combines relaxing gameplay with mind-bending puzzles. Dive into hundreds of carefully designed levels, all set to calming background music, offering a delightful gaming experience.\n\n<b>How to Play</b>\nJust swipe your finger over cells that have a number. The number tells you how many cells you can fill in any direction (up, down, left, right). If a cell is already full, don't worry! Your line will just move to the next open cell. And as you drag, you'll see a highlight showing you which cells will fill up.\n\n<b>Features</b>\n- Hundreds of hand-crafted puzzles\n- Beautiful and immersive visuals\n- A relaxing and meditative soundtrack\n- Improves your focus and creativity\n- Cloud saving and achievements\n\nEnjoy!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $18.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aAXoCxnVwG0?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QskQLd0b5z2cUzxTxVM6hiDP0LEmBd0vi3yiecp1DyzGyZrO1QX7TEU-QciBYwzVBxSfvHmriPg-ilVNNnFtrQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kil3SZLAvYt0yKBkNWlQdt4d2AsGAWMt4epw2AZnQ4l4ZH45ukRNNKFHIgMNWI5Y_14aryuYwILSLZuHqxWxQw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AX44EWs0_9GZyfpnpeknvaZ2wT_1RBWInssdaNTw9OeHwMSCFSWjSDwkTyUoMPL8o1pdSINWaQv-iz1AvW5scQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DMa2t0M3DUN0a8F6kO_4-uuhVplY0lfEXBK9PCtqOEeLbAZnbloxRRz_oo4_oz43NYYGV36fysMcxJ9y5F6Qnw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6FwYZQl_hUvMuIj3g75OYJ9Pu7XllApdB4StfJv5lszlowMZguCc1bElrnzz38ll0Iey3sBA3YIkDLw8-DcbWbc","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ehbkINDXNucTnMeW-uHN3P-aGxsLw-r3QHB0xI94L5MWRj7My2hZeFH45uS-ANyPGgH8ip_wnM4b7QhK8YJQjvA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zdhDHmIORNL5DwnaEgrRImuJNYSf1dtUuuzOh7kC5c35UUkV7OJomhAZ0Fo3v_wEOKX3c5RGGfXKjBRUevoIFPA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com